OL,3,GNEWSAFunding secured to enhance
OL,4,Amedieval castle
OL,5,
OL,6,FFunding has been secured for safety and
OL,7,Fremedial work at a medieval castle in
OL,8,Fthe Cheshire town of Runcorn.
OL,10,FHalton Borough Council said the work at
OL,11,FHalton Castle would improve safety and
OL,12,Fsecurity and enable safe public access.
OL,14,FThe authority said undergrowth would
OL,15,Fcontinue to be cut back to reveal more
OL,16,Fof the Grade I-listed castle's
OL,17,Fremaining features.
OL,19,FReform UK councillor John Davies, who
OL,20,Frepresents Halton Castle ward, said he
OL,21,Fwas "absolutely made up" by the
OL,22,Fannouncement.
